{"id":"1dd9f6247717bebe","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-covermatrix.md","title":"Prime covering matrix and minimal column covers","display":"df-covermatrix — Prime covering matrix and minimal column covers","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-covermatrix","aliases":["27-df-covermatrix"],"display":"df-covermatrix — Prime covering matrix and minimal column covers","depends_on":["[[27-df-piset]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§3.3.1; §3.3.2 equation (3.12)","source_printed_pages":"143,144,147","source_pdf_pages":"167,168,171","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-covermatrix"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-covermatrix</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-covermatrix — Prime covering matrix and minimal column covers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.3.1; §3.3.2 equation (3.12)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"143,144,147"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"167,168,171"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,C\">\\(R,C\\)</span> 为有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle\">\\(A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\cdot\\rangle\\)</span> 是单射有限元组编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R&#39;\\subseteq R\">\\(R&#39;\\subseteq R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C&#39;\\subseteq C\">\\(C&#39;\\subseteq C\\)</span>；函数图的限制采用通常集合论限制。另取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>。矩阵求值、保留行列载体的矩阵限制、覆盖族与素项覆盖矩阵由下式构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle R,C,a\\rangle(r,j)\\coloneqq a(r,j)\\quad((r,j)\\in R\\times C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle R,C,a\\rangle(r,j)\\coloneqq a(r,j)\\quad((r,j)\\in R\\times C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left.\\langle R,C,a\\rangle\\right|_{R&#39;\\times C&#39;}\\coloneqq\\langle R&#39;,C&#39;,a|_{R&#39;\\times C&#39;}\\rangle\\quad(R&#39;\\subseteq R,\\ C&#39;\\subseteq C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left.\\langle R,C,a\\rangle\\right|_{R&#39;\\times C&#39;}\\coloneqq\\langle R&#39;,C&#39;,a|_{R&#39;\\times C&#39;}\\rangle\\quad(R&#39;\\subseteq R,\\ C&#39;\\subseteq C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cov}(\\langle R,C,a\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq C\\mid\\forall r\\in R\\;\\exists j\\in S\\;a(r,j)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cov}(\\langle R,C,a\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq C\\mid\\forall r\\in R\\;\\exists j\\in S\\;a(r,j)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MinCov}(A)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\mid\\forall U\\subsetneq S\\;U\\notin\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MinCov}(A)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\mid\\forall U\\subsetneq S\\;U\\notin\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_f\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid f(x)=1\\},\\qquad a_f\\coloneqq\\{((x,P),P(x))\\mid(x,P)\\in T_f\\times\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_f\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid f(x)=1\\},\\qquad a_f\\coloneqq\\{((x,P),P(x))\\mid(x,P)\\in T_f\\times\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PCov}(f)\\coloneqq\\langle T_f,\\mathrm{PI}(f),a_f\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PCov}(f)\\coloneqq\\langle T_f,\\mathrm{PI}(f),a_f\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PCov}(f)(x,P)=P(x)\\quad((x,P)\\in T_f\\times\\mathrm{PI}(f)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PCov}(f)(x,P)=P(x)\\quad((x,P)\\in T_f\\times\\mathrm{PI}(f)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>矩阵的行对应真点，列对应素项；选列覆盖所有行就得到素 DNF。MinCov 表示包含意义下的极小覆盖，对应素且不可删项的 DNF。矩阵编码保留行集与列集，因此即使数值函数图为空，也能区分零行矩阵和含零列的矩阵，并使约简后的限制单值。行集为空时空列集是唯一极小覆盖；非空行集而列集为空时没有覆盖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R,C$ 为有限集，$a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle$；$\\langle\\cdot\\rangle$ 是单射有限元组编码。$R'\\subseteq R$、$C'\\subseteq C$；函数图的限制采用通常集合论限制。另取 $n\\in\\mathbb N^+$、$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]。矩阵求值、保留行列载体的矩阵限制、覆盖族与素项覆盖矩阵由下式构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R,C","display":false},{"tex":"a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\cdot\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"R'\\subseteq R","display":false},{"tex":"C'\\subseteq C","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N^+","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle R,C,a\\rangle(r,j)\\coloneqq a(r,j)\\quad((r,j)\\in R\\times C).","display":true},{"tex":"\\left.\\langle R,C,a\\rangle\\right|_{R'\\times C'}\\coloneqq\\langle R',C',a|_{R'\\times C'}\\rangle\\quad(R'\\subseteq R,\\ C'\\subseteq C).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cov}(\\langle R,C,a\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq C\\mid\\forall r\\in R\\;\\exists j\\in S\\;a(r,j)=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MinCov}(A)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\mid\\forall U\\subsetneq S\\;U\\notin\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"T_f\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid f(x)=1\\},\\qquad a_f\\coloneqq\\{((x,P),P(x))\\mid(x,P)\\in T_f\\times\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PCov}(f)\\coloneqq\\langle T_f,\\mathrm{PI}(f),a_f\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PCov}(f)(x,P)=P(x)\\quad((x,P)\\in T_f\\times\\mathrm{PI}(f)).","display":true}],"bytes":2442,"backlinks":[{"id":"ef985ef690eaa6d0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R,C$ 为非空有限集，$a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle$，且 $\\forall r\\in R\\;\\exists j\\in C\\;A(r,j)=1$。$q\\in\\mathbb N$，$1\\le q\\le\\min\\{|R|,|C|\\}$，$\\mathbf j=(j_1,\\ldots,j_q)\\in C^q$；不预设各项互异。矩阵编码、求值与 $\\mathrm{Cov}$ 见 [[27-df-covermatrix]]。未覆盖集、运行谓词与输出覆盖族由下式构造。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-covermatrix|df-covermatrix — Prime covering matrix and minimal column covers]]"},{"id":"56ea983120112160","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R,C$ 为有限集，$a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle$，$\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\ne\\varnothing$；$\\mathrm{Cov}$ 见 [[27-df-covermatrix]]。$i,j\\in C$，$i\\ne j$，且 $A(r,i)\\ge A(r,j)$ 对所有 $r\\in R$ 成立。"},{"id":"1085c5946fe8e449","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$R,C$ 为有限集，$a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle$；$\\mathrm{Cov},\\mathrm{MinCov}$ 见 [[27-df-covermatrix]]。$A|_{R'\\times C'}$ 是 [[27-df-covermatrix]] 中保留行列载体的矩阵限制；各条约简中的行列索引在对应公式内量化。"},{"id":"0260751b03daa79e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R,C,A$ 满足 [[27-df-greedycover]] 的假设，$S\\in\\mathrm{GreedyCover}(A)$，$\\mathrm{Cov}$ 见 [[27-df-covermatrix]]。$d=\\max_{j\\in C}|\\{r\\in R\\mid A(r,j)=1\\}|\\ge1$，$m=\\min_{Q\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)}|Q|$。"}],"outgoing":["3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2"]}